# ==============================================================================
# InvoiceOps Lab monorepo — .gitignore
# Context: RPA / Power Platform / Dataverse / PAD / UiPath / AA / n8n /
#          Python / .NET / Node / Cloudflare Workers+D1 / PostgreSQL / SQLite /
#          Robot Framework / Power BI / PM4Py / GitHub Actions.
#
# Policy:
# - Commit source code, migrations, tests, deterministic configuration and lock files.
# - Never commit credentials, auth profiles, tokens, local runtime state, databases,
#   build outputs, caches, transient logs/screenshots, or workstation-specific state.
# - Do NOT blanket-ignore reports/, analytics/, *.pbix, *.pdf, *.json or *.csv:
#   InvoiceOps intentionally has generated/test/release artifacts that may be tracked
#   or attached to releases later. Ignore only explicitly-local/generated locations.
# ==============================================================================


# ==============================================================================
# 1. OPERATING SYSTEM / FILE EXPLORER NOISE
# ==============================================================================

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
ehthumbs_vista.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.stackdump

# macOS (harmless if the repo is ever opened there)
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
._*

# Linux desktop / editor trash
*~
.fuse_hidden*
.directory
.Trash-*
.nfs*


# ==============================================================================
# 2. EDITORS / IDEs / USER-SPECIFIC WORKSTATION STATE
# ==============================================================================

# Visual Studio
.vs/
**/.vs/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser
*.userprefs
*.DotSettings.user
*.csproj.user
*.vcxproj.user

# VS Code: local/user workspace state is ignored by default.
# If later you intentionally want shared workspace settings, explicitly force-add
# only reviewed files (for example: git add -f .vscode/extensions.json).
.vscode/
**/.vscode/

# JetBrains / other IDEs
.idea/
**/.idea/
*.iml
.history/
**/.history/

# Temporary editor files
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.autosave


